---
slug: mcp-tools
layout: ''
---
{%- comment -%}
  MCP token console (operator UX, part of the module so it travels with the
  standalone repo). A logged-in member mints a PER-USER bearer token bound to
  their identity, sees the exact client-connect command once, and can revoke.

  Login-gated via context.current_user. The raw token is shown ONCE (passed via a
  one-shot session flash after minting) — only its digest is stored.

  STYLING: gruvbox-dark TUI (square corners, flat surfaces, monospace) to match the
  operator console. ONE html skeleton + ONE <style> block; the three states (signed
  out / no access / token console) branch only the inner content. NO inline style=""
  attributes anywhere — all presentation is in classes.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  # SECURITY: never cache this page. It is authenticated and briefly renders a
  # one-shot RAW bearer token (via the session flash below). `no-store` also makes
  # the page bfcache-ineligible, so Back/Forward cannot restore the rendered token
  # from browser history — it forces a server round-trip, by which point the flash
  # has already been consumed and the token is gone.
  response_headers '{"Cache-Control": "no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache"}'
  assign uid = context.current_user.id | append: ''
  assign host = context.location.host
  assign endpoint = 'https://' | append: host | append: '/mcp'
  # Client-side connection alias for `claude mcp add`. Defaults to the configured
  # server_name (MCP_CONFIG.server_name, default 'pos-module-mcp') so operators can
  # brand it; falls back to the host if that is somehow blank.
  function cfg = 'modules/mcp/commands/config'
  assign server_name = cfg.server_name | default: host
  # Access is approval-gated: only members with level admin|user may mint tokens.
  function acc = 'modules/mcp/commands/access/level'
  assign level = acc.level
  assign can_mint = false
  if level == 'admin' or level == 'user'
    assign can_mint = true
  endif
  if can_mint
    graphql toks = 'modules/mcp/tokens/for_user', user_id: uid
    assign rows = toks.records.results
    assign flash = context.session.mcp_flash_token
    session mcp_flash_token = null
  endif
-%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
<title>MCP tokens</title>
<style>
  /* Gruvbox-dark TUI — mirrors the operator console (modules/mcp/.../mcp-admin.liquid). */
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --bg: #14152E;          /* navy page background (override of gruvbox bg0) */
    --bg-2: #0d0e1f;        /* darker navy — code blocks / inputs */
    --panel: #2b2838;       /* warm dark indigo — cards */
    --panel-2: #393450;     /* warm indigo — raised */
    --border: #4c4560;      /* warm indigo-gray — visible TUI borders */
    --border-soft: #393450; /* warm indigo — dividers */
    --text: #ebdbb2;        /* fg */
    --muted: #a89984;       /* white */
    --dim: #928374;         /* bright black */
    --accent: #83a598;      /* bright blue — links */
    --ok: #b8bb26;   --ok-bg: #333a1e;   /* bright green */
    --bad: #fb4934;  --bad-bg: #3f2120;  /* bright red */
    --warn: #fabd2f; --warn-bg: #3d3420; /* bright yellow */
    --mono: ui-monospace, "JetBrains Mono", "SFMono-Regular", "Cascadia Code", Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { background: var(--bg); }
  body { font-family: var(--mono); margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--muted);
         line-height: 1.55; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .wrap { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1rem 4rem; }
  .wrap.center { max-width: 34rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 2rem 0 .5rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .lead { color: var(--muted); }

  .card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .card.new { border-color: var(--ok); }
  .card.new h2 { margin-top: 0; color: var(--ok); }

  code, pre { font-family: var(--mono); }
  pre { background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0; padding: .8rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text); }
  .token { color: var(--ok); word-break: break-all; }
  .warn { color: var(--warn); font-size: .85rem; }
  .pending { color: var(--warn); }

  .btn { font: inherit; padding: .5rem .9rem; border-radius: 0; border: 1px solid var(--ok); background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; }
  .btn:hover { background: #3f4a20; }
  .btn-revoke { border-color: var(--bad); background: var(--bad-bg); color: var(--bad); padding: .25rem .6rem; font-size: .78rem; }
  .btn-revoke:hover { background: #4a2926; }

  .field { font: inherit; padding: .5rem; border-radius: 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-2); color: var(--text); width: 16rem; }
  label { color: var(--muted); }
  .mint-form { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .mt-1 { margin-top: 1rem; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .85rem; }
  td, th { text-align: left; padding: .45rem .4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .revoked { color: var(--dim); text-decoration: line-through; }

  /* ── Slight motion (CSS-only, JS-free). Disabled under prefers-reduced-motion. ── */
  .card { transition: border-color .15s ease, transform .12s ease; }
  .card:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn { transition: background .12s ease, border-color .12s ease; }
  .wrap { animation: fadeInUp .3s ease both; }
  .card.new { animation: fadeInUp .3s ease both, okGlow 1.6s ease-in-out .3s 2; }
  @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes okGlow { 0%, 100% { border-color: var(--ok); } 50% { border-color: var(--ok-bg); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, ::before, ::after { animation: none !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    .card:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{%- if uid == blank -%}
<div class="wrap center">
  <h1>MCP tokens</h1>
  <p class="lead">Please <a href="/sessions/new">sign in</a> to generate a token for connecting an MCP client to this community.</p>
</div>
{%- elsif can_mint == false -%}
<div class="wrap center">
  <h1>MCP access</h1>
  {%- if level == 'requested' -%}
    <p class="lead">Your request for MCP access is <b class="pending">pending operator approval</b>. You’ll be able to generate a connection token here once an operator approves it.</p>
  {%- else -%}
    <p class="lead">Connecting an MCP client to this community requires operator approval. Request access and an operator will review it.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/mcp-tools/request" class="mt-1">
      <input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="{{ context.authenticity_token }}">
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Request access</button>
    </form>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
{%- else -%}
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Your MCP connection tokens</h1>
  <p class="lead">Generate a bearer token to connect an MCP client (e.g. Claude Code) to this community as <b>you</b>. Every call it makes is authorized as your identity and recorded.</p>

  {%- if flash != blank -%}
  <div class="card new">
    <h2>✓ New token — copy it now, it will not be shown again</h2>
    <p class="token"><code>{{ flash }}</code></p>
    <p>Add it to Claude Code:</p>
    <pre>claude mcp add --transport http {{ server_name }} {{ endpoint }} --header "Authorization: Bearer {{ flash }}"</pre>
    <p class="warn">Only the token’s fingerprint is stored — we cannot recover this value. If you lose it, revoke it and mint a new one.</p>
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="card">
    <form method="post" action="/mcp-tools/mint" class="mint-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="{{ context.authenticity_token }}">
      <label>Label <input type="text" name="label" placeholder="my laptop" maxlength="40" class="field"></label>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Generate token</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <h2>Existing tokens</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>label</th><th>status</th><th>created</th><th></th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {%- for t in rows -%}
      <tr>
        <td class="{% if t.status != 'active' %}revoked{% endif %}">{{ t.label }}</td>
        <td>{{ t.status }}</td>
        <td>{{ t.created_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}</td>
        <td>
          {%- if t.status == 'active' -%}
          <form method="post" action="/mcp-tools/revoke" onsubmit="return confirm('Revoke this token? Clients using it stop working immediately.')">
            <input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="{{ context.authenticity_token }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ t.id }}">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-revoke">Revoke</button>
          </form>
          {%- endif -%}
        </td>
      </tr>
    {%- endfor -%}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
</body>
</html>
